<title>USA: Moovies Inc Q4 same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Moovies Inc Q4 same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moovies Inc said same- store revenues for its fourth quarter increased about three percent, and said it completed an amendment to its line of credit agreement, increasing the line to $30.0 million from $22.5 million.</p>
<p>It said it opened 18 new stores during the fourth quarter ended December 31, bringing the total new stores opened for the year to 50, which is in accordance with its previously stated objective.</p>
<p>Management also noted that during the year it added 30 stores through selected acquisitions.  At the close of 1996, Moovies operated 223 video specialty superstores in 16 states.</p>
</text>
